virtbase-pve-patches (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. Ships the snippet-upload, snippet-mode and hookscript
    patches with a dpkg trigger that reapplies them after any package writes
    under /usr/share/perl5/PVE, and publishes their state as Prometheus
    textfile metrics.

